  "decisions": [
    "Tutorial: LevelChip shows 'Practice' + flag; rail is visible because the tutorial has a real duration.",
    "Endless: ProgressRail hidden. There is no goal, and anything else (distance, best) would need data the game doesn't have.",
    "Rail on the left: pause is top-right; the left band keeps the right thumb area clear.",
    "Low-time warning kept on the rail fill (mint -> peach under 17% remaining), not in the header.",
    "Bush hitbox stays 120 x 160; first bush not before 6 s."
  ]
